# Allowlist: the image only needs the package and the scripts.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!scripts/

# Never in the image, even if the allowlist above is widened. The authors' release has no licence,
# results/ holds their rendered images, and keys live only in the host environment or .env.
third_party/
data/
results/
.venv/
.git/
.env
**/.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
